        "label": "Launch — Molniya-M",
        "description": "Baikonur Cosmodrome, 1966-01-31. Luna 9 — the first spacecraft to achieve a soft landing on the Moon (or anywhere off-Earth). 11 earlier Soviet soft-landing attempts had failed (Luna 9 was the twelfth)."
